# ============================================================================
# Large data files (ephemerides, debias catalogs) — globally ignored.
# These are external binary blobs (hundreds of MB each) — document their
# sources in README and either auto-download in CMake or require manual
# placement.  Typical sizes: linux_p1550p2650.440 ~98MB,
# sb441-n16 ~616MB, bias.dat ~50MB.
# ============================================================================
*.bsp
*.440
*.430
*.421
bias.dat
tiles.dat
/data/debias_fcct14/xcat.bias_fcct14
/data/debias/efcc18.dat
/data/debias/fcct14.dat
/data/debias/efcc18_tiles.dat
# …but keep lightweight companions — MPC observatory list, full docs/,
# examples/ (MPEC test cases), and any README inside data/:
!data/obs.txt
!data/docs/
!data/docs/**
!data/examples/
!data/examples/**
!data/**/*.md
!data/**/README*

